# ============================================================
#  THE HOLLOW STAR, v2 (docs/plots/hollowstar-v2.md): how the plot is wired.
#
#  The arc's clock (content/world/arcs.grim) still runs on its schedule, but the beats are deadlines: an act's
#  climax raises the clock to the next act's opener (`advance hollowstar to N`), so a player who pushes the
#  investigation opens the next act early; one who doesn't is reached by the deadline anyway.
#    Act I    omens          opener clock 1  hs_lake_breathes   climax hs_grey_stranger (beat 2)  -> 4
#    Act II   investigation  opener clock 4  hs_ilse_arrives    climax hs_frost_ring (beat 5)     -> 7
#    Act III  escalation     opener clock 7  hs_dark_tower      climax hs_grey_daylight (beat 8)  -> 10
#    Act IV   convergence    opener clock 10 hs_last_winter     the Night at 12 (y4m9), or earlier by hs_go_down_early
#  Each act's cards are a story thread (its steps wait on the act being open, not on a month); the Night is a
#  scene, played in one sitting, and its outcome cards close the arc.
#  Every fight in the plot sits beside at least one way that isn't a fight, and losing one never closes the
#  story off (2026-10-26).
# ============================================================

@cond hs_act
desc: The Hollow Star's act n (1 omens … 4 convergence) has opened: the clock has reached its opener.
params: n
is: clock(hollowstar) >= 3 * n - 2

@thread hs_omens
desc: Act I: the lake breathes; the bell, the founders' ledger and the black-star dream, in any order.
from: story
with: begun=hs_act(1)
arc: hollowstar
members:
  start hs_lake_breathes

@thread hs_investigation
desc: Act II: Ilse arrives; Kael's secret, Ilse's, and the man in grey's offer.
from: story
with: begun=hs_act(2)
arc: hollowstar
members:
  start hs_ilse_arrives

@thread hs_escalation
desc: Act III: the cult strikes; sides are taken; the locks, the key and your shadow.
from: story
with: begun=hs_act(3)
arc: hollowstar
members:
  start hs_dark_tower

@thread hs_convergence
desc: Act IV: the last winter; who stands with you; going down early.
from: story
with: begun=hs_act(4)
arc: hollowstar
members:
  start hs_last_winter

@thread hs_night
desc: The Night the lake froze, in one sitting: who comes down with you, the cult on the ice, the man in grey, Ilse, your shadow, the founders' wall and the door.
from: scene
arc: hollowstar
members:
  entry hs_the_night

# ---------------- Progress: each act's finds raise the clock toward its climax ----------------

@preset hs_omens_progress
desc: Two of Act I's three finds (the bell; the founders' seal, from the ledger or from Maud; the black-star dream) bring its climax (the clock to 2).
do:
  if clue(lake_bell) + clue(knows_founders_seal) + has(hollow_dreams) >= 2:
    advance hollowstar to 2

@preset hs_investigation_progress
desc: Two of Act II's truths (Kael's family, what Ilse was raised for, the Codex's names, the man in grey's offer) bring its climax (the clock to 5).
do:
  if clue(kael_family) + clue(ilse_truth) + clue(codex_names) + flag(grey_offer_seen) >= 2:
    advance hollowstar to 5

@preset hs_escalation_progress
desc: Two of Act III's (the seven locks, the star key, your second shadow, a side taken) bring its climax (the clock to 8).
do:
  if clue(seven_locks) + clue(star_key) + clue(second_shadow) + (flag(sided_wardens) or flag(sided_dumonts) or flag(sided_self)) >= 2:
    advance hollowstar to 8

# ---------------- The Night: who is called, and who comes ----------------

@cond hs_called
desc: The Night calls you down: you followed the plot far enough, or the Star counts you as its own, and you didn't walk away.
is: (not flag(hollow_out) or flag(hollow_tempted) or flag(hollow_courted)) and (clues(hollowstar) >= 3 or flag(warden_trial) or flag(kael_ally) or flag(sided_wardens) or flag(sided_dumonts) or flag(sided_self) or flag(wardens_noticed) or flag(hollow_courted) or alignment <= -60)

@cond night_kael
desc: Kael would come down with you: an ally, or he trained with you; if you go early, only if he promised.
is: met(kael) and (flag(winter_kael) or (flag(kael_ally) and not flag(hs_early)))

@cond night_ilse
desc: Ilse would come down with you: saved, still here, and (if you go early) promised.
is: met(ilse) and flag(ilse_saved) and not flag(ilse_went_north) and (flag(winter_ilse) or (rel(ilse) >= 15 and not flag(hs_early)))

@cond night_maud
desc: Maud would come down with you, Edmund's wand in hand.
is: met(maud) and (flag(winter_maud) or (flag(edmunds_wand) and not flag(hs_early)))

@cond night_isolde
desc: The headmistress would come down with you, her Wardens behind.
is: met(isolde) and (flag(winter_isolde) or ((flag(warden_trial) or flag(sided_wardens)) and not flag(hs_early)))
